<title>ITALY: Italy's Marzotto to pay 270 lire dividend.</title>
<headline>Italy's Marzotto to pay 270 lire dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian textiles group Marzotto said it would pay a 1996 ordinary dividend of 270 lire, up from 230 lire in 1995, and a savings dividend of 330 lire, up from 290 lire previously.</p>
<p>The dividend on convertible savings shares would be 290 lire from 250 previously.</p>
</text>
